  "description": "V-KDF-1..6 exact byte'lar\u0131 (ccr \u00a735.2.1 D1-D7). V-KDF-7 (\u00fc\u00e7 kaynak e\u015fitli\u011fi) bir vaka de\u011fil bir S\u00dcRE\u00c7 \u015fart\u0131d\u0131r: bu dosya ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z referanst\u0131r; Rust taraf\u0131 ayn\u0131 de\u011ferleri \u00fcretince sa\u011flanm\u0131\u015f olur. KDF = Extract(salt = ASCII(label), IKM = secret) ard\u0131ndan Expand(info = context). out_len_hex verilmemi\u015fse L = 32.",
